{"term": {"label": "義", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i", "title": "滕文公上", "description": "滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不", "occurrences": 2, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "方", "id": "方"}, {"form": "物", "id": "物"}, {"form": "界", "id": "界"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "經", "id": "經"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.6046646336814427, "source": "聞", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.6916760106710724, "source": "聞", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.7032769223495525, "source": "聞", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 2.010129741789607, "source": "聞", "target": "方"}, {"weight": 2.297811814241388, "source": "聞", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 0.6883739018072876, "source": "聞", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.028148247292285, "source": "先", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.634284050862601, "source": "先", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.34660197841082, "source": "先", "target": "方"}, {"weight": 2.7032769223495525, "source": "物", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 3.262892710284975, "source": "政", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.6567569067146595, "source": "政", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 3.262892710284975, "source": "政", "target": "行"}, {"weight": 2.56974552972503, "source": "政", "target": "界"}, {"weight": 2.56974552972503, "source": "政", "target": "經"}, {"weight": 2.56974552972503, "source": "政", "target": "方"}, {"weight": 1.2479896897427103, "source": "禮", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.55814461804655, "source": "禮", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.8574276021768106, "source": "禮", "target